Appendix I: Summary of Key Formulas

I.1 Power Mean

M_p(\mathbf{D}, \mathbf{w}) = \left( \sum_i w_i D_i^p \right)^{1/p}, \quad p \in \mathbb{R} \setminus \{0\}.

M_0 = \prod_i D_i^{w_i}, \quad M_{-\infty} = \min_i D_i, \quad M_{\infty} = \max_i D_i.

I.2 Capability Balance Index

\text{CBI} = 1 - \frac{M_0}{M_1}.

I.3 Uncertainty Propagation

\text{Var}(S) \approx \sum_i \sum_j \frac{\partial S}{\partial D_i} \frac{\partial S}{\partial D_j} \Sigma_{ij}.

\frac{\partial S}{\partial D_j} = w_j \left( \frac{D_j}{S} \right)^{p-1} \quad (p \neq 0), \qquad
\frac{\partial S}{\partial D_j} = S \frac{w_j}{D_j} \quad (p=0).

I.4 Sensitivity Analysis

\Delta S_p = \max\left( S(p_{\text{chosen}}) - S(p_{\min}),\; S(p_{\max}) - S(p_{\text{chosen}}) \right).

\Delta S_w = \max_{k=1,\ldots,m} \left| S(p, \mathbf{w}^{(k)}) - S(p, \mathbf{w}_{\text{chosen}}) \right|.

I.5 BoD DEA

\theta^*_s = \max_{\mathbf{w} \geq 0} \sum_i w_i D_i^{(s)} \quad \text{s.t.} \quad \sum_i w_i D_i^{(s')} \leq 1 \;\; \forall s' \in \mathcal{R}.

\bar{\theta}_s = \frac{1}{|\mathcal{R}|} \sum_{s' \in \mathcal{R}} \sum_i w^{*}_{s',i} D_i^{(s)}.

I.6 Safety-Envelope Composite

S_{\text{safe}} = \min\left( S_{\text{Tier1}}^{(p=0)},\; S_{\text{Tier2}}^{(p=1)},\; S_{\text{Tier3}}^{(p=-1)} \right).

I.7 Dependence-Adjusted Score

\tilde{D}_3^* = \Phi\left( \frac{D_3 - (\hat{\alpha} + \hat{\beta} D_2)}{\hat{\sigma}_\varepsilon} \right).

I.8 Contamination Down-Weighting

D_{\text{final}} = \frac{\sum_{i \in \text{Green}} s_i + \gamma \sum_{i \in \text{Yellow}} s_i}{\sum_{i \in \text{Green}} 1 + \gamma \sum_{i \in \text{Yellow}} 1}.

