|                                                                                       |
|              v                                                                        |
|  6. TIER AGGREGATION                                                                  |
|     Tier 1: geometric mean (p=0)  |  Tier 2: arithmetic (p=1)  |  Tier 3: harmonic (p=-1)|
|     + CBI per tier                                                                   |
|                                                                                       |
|              v                                                                        |
|  7. UNCERTAINTY PROPAGATION (delta method + conformal for Tier 3)                     |
|     Var(S) = ∇fᵀ Σ ∇f    (or bootstrap near boundaries)                               |
|                                                                                       |
|              v                                                                        |
|  8. SENSITIVITY ANALYSIS                                                              |
|     ΔS_p, ΔS_w, interpretation‑band transition probability                            |
|                                                                                       |
|              v                                                                        |
|  9. SAFETY‑ENVELOPE COMPOSITE                                                         |
|     S_safe = min( Tier1, Tier2, Tier3 )                                               |
|                                                                                       |
|              v                                                                        |
| 10. DEPLOYMENT AUTONOMY MAPPING                                                       |
|     Tool < 0.3  |  Supervised 0.3–0.6  |  Collaborative 0.6–0.8  |  Autonomous ≥0.8   |
|                                                                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
